cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rsemflow: Metadata-Driven Downstream Analysis for RSEM Gene-Level Results"
authors:
  - family-names: Kumakura
    given-names: Daiki
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9859-0720"
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/rsemflow"
url: "https://daikikumakura.github.io/software/rsemflow.html"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An R package and command-line tool that turns RSEM *.genes.results files and a sample metadata table into standard bulk RNA-seq results as TSV tables: expression summaries, normalization, PCA, sample correlation, DESeq2 differential expression, preranked GSEA, GSVA/ssGSEA scores and gene annotation.
keywords:
  - "RNA-seq"
  - "RSEM"
  - "DESeq2"
  - "GSEA"
  - "GSVA"
  - "R package"
